{"speciesId":148,"names":{"fr":"Draco","es":"Dragonair","en":"Dragonair","ja":"ハクリュー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"A mystical POKéMON that exudes a gentle aura. Has the ability to change climate conditions."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"A mystical POKéMON that exudes a gentle aura. Has the ability to change climate conditions."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"According to a witness, its body was surrounded by a strange aura that gave it a mystical look."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"They say that if it emits an aura from its whole body, the weather will begin to change instantly."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its crystalline orbs appear to give this POKéMON the power to freely control the weather."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It is called the divine POKéMON. When its entire body brightens slightly, the weather changes."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"DRAGONAIR stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter weather conditions in its vicinity by discharging energy from the crystals on its neck and tail."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"DRAGONAIR stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter weather conditions in its vicinity by discharging energy from the crystals on its neck and tail."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A DRAGONAIR stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter the weather around it by loosing energy from the crystals on its neck and tail."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is said to live in seas and lakes. Even though it has no wings, it has been seen flying occasionally."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"A mystical POKéMON that exudes a gentle aura. It is said to have the ability to change the weather."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"They say that if it emits an aura from its whole body, the weather will begin to change instantly."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its crystalline orbs appear to give this Pokémon the power to freely control the weather."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La météo change brusquement quand il est entouré d’une aura. On dit qu’il peuple les mers et les lacs."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La météo change brusquement quand il est entouré d’une aura. On dit qu’il peuple les mers et les lacs."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses orbes de cristal donnent le pouvoir de contrôler le climat."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus cristalinos orbes parecen darle al Pokémon el poder de controlar el clima libremente."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its crystalline orbs appear to give this Pokémon the power to freely control the weather."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"水晶のような 玉には 天候を 自由に 操る 能力が 秘められているらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon légendaire plein de charme. Il peut contrôler les variations climatiques."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es un Pokémon misterioso. Está rodeado de una sutil aura y tiene la capacidad de cambiar el clima."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"A mystical Pokémon that exudes a gentle aura. It is said to have the ability to change the weather."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"オーラに 包まれる 神聖な 生き物らしい。天気を 変える 力を 持つと 言われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Draco stocke une quantité d’énergie considérable dans son corps. On raconte qu’il peut modifier les conditions climatiques autour de lui en déchargeant l’énergie contenue dans les cristaux de son cou et de sa queue."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dragonair acumula grandes cantidades de energía dentro de sí. Dicen que altera el clima de la zona en la que está descargando energía a través de las esferas de cristal que tiene en el cuello y en la cola."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dragonair stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter weather conditions in its vicinity by discharging energy from the crystals on its neck and tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大きな エネルギーを 体に ためている。 首と 尻尾の 水晶から エネルギーを 解き放ち あたりの 天気を 変えると いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Draco stocke une quantité d’énergie considérable dans son corps. On raconte qu’il peut modifier les conditions climatiques autour de lui en déchargeant l’énergie contenue dans les cristaux de son cou et de sa queue."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dragonair acumula grandes cantidades de energía dentro de sí. Dicen que altera el clima de la zona en la que está descargando energía a través de las esferas de cristal que tiene en el cuello y en la cola."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dragonair stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter weather conditions in its vicinity by discharging energy from the crystals on its neck and tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"大きな エネルギーを 体に ためている。 首と 尻尾の 水晶から エネルギーを 解き放ち あたりの 天気を 変えると いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Beaucoup pensent que les orbes cristallins de ce Pokémon ont le pouvoir de modifier le climat."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se dice que sus cristalinos orbes confieren a este Pokémon el poder de controlar el clima."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It has long been thought that its crystalline orbs are imbued with the power to control the weather."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"水晶の ような 玉には 天候を 操る パワーが 秘められていると いわれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il est adoré depuis l’Antiquité dans certaines communautés paysannes en tant que divinité des conditions climatiques."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Ha sido venerado desde tiempos ancestrales por los pueblos agrícolas, debido a que con sus poderes puede controlar el clima."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"From time immemorial, it has been venerated by agricultural peoples as an entity able to control the weather."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"天候を 司る 者として 太古から 農業を 営む 人々に 崇められてきた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"On raconte que ce Pokémon a le pouvoir de modifier le climat. Les offrandes affluent donc au bord des lacs où il vit."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Existe la creencia de que puede controlar el clima y a menudo se hallan ofrendas a orillas de los lagos donde habita."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Lakes where Dragonair live are filled with offerings from people, because they believe this Pokémon is able to control the weather."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"天候を 操ると 信じられ ハクリューの 棲む 湖には お供え物が 絶えない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Voir ce Pokémon serpenter dans le ciel au réveillon présage d’une bonne santé pour la nouvelle année."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se dice que ver a este Pokémon serpenteando por los cielos en año nuevo es augurio de buena salud para el año entrante."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Some say that if you see it at the start of the year, flying through the sky and twisting its body, you’ll be healthy all year long."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"年明けに 身体を くねらせながら 空を 飛ぶ 姿を 見られると １年 健康だと いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Selon des témoins, son corps est baigné d’une étrange aura lui donnant un air mystique."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Según un testigo, está rodeado por una extraña aura, que le da un aspecto misterioso y místico."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"According to a witness, its body was surrounded by a strange aura that gave it a mystical look."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"目撃した 人の 話によると 体からは オーラが 出されて 神秘的だった という。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Selon des témoins, son corps est baigné d’une étrange aura lui donnant un air mystique."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Según un testigo, está rodeado por una extraña aura, que le da un aspecto misterioso y místico."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"According to a witness, its body was surrounded by a strange aura that gave it a mystical look."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"目撃した 人の 話によると 体からは オーラが 出されて 神秘的だった という。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il vit dans les mers et les lacs aux eaux claires. Sa maîtrise de la météo lui permet de s’élever dans le ciel en se laissant porter par le vent."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Vive en lagos y mares de aguas cristalinas. Su poder para controlar el clima le permite alzar el vuelo llevado por el viento."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon lives in pristine oceans and lakes. It can control the weather, and it uses this power to fly into the sky, riding on the wind."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"きれいな 海や 湖に 棲む。 天候を 操る 力で 風に 乗り 空へと 昇る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il contrôle la météo en accumulant de l’énergie dans les orbes au bout de sa queue. Sa silhouette nimbée d’une aura lui confère un air mystique."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Acumula energía en las esferas de la cola para controlar el clima. La sutil aura que lo rodea le confiere un aspecto misterioso y místico."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon gathers power in the orbs on its tail and controls the weather. When enshrouded by an aura, Dragonair has a mystical appearance."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"尻尾の 玉に 力を 集めて 天候を 操る。 オーラを まとう 姿は 神秘的。"}],"varieties":[{"id":148,"moves":[{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[1,"level-up",35],[2,"level-up",35],[3,"level-up",29],[4,"level-up",29],[5,"level-up",29],[6,"level-up",29],[7,"level-up",29],[8,"level-up",21],[9,"level-up",21],[10,"level-up",21],[11,"level-up",21],[12,"level-up",29],[13,"level-up",29],[14,"level-up",21],[15,"level-up",21],[16,"level-up",21],[17,"level-up",21],[18,"level-up",21],[19,"level-up",40],[20,"level-up",25],[23,"level-up",25],[25,"level-up",25],[28,"level-up",35],[29,"level-up",35]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"horn-drill","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"wrap","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"lev